Package: mospiR
Type: Package
Title: Client for the 'MoSPI' Microdata Portal
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Saket", "Choudhary", , "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633"))
Description: Download unit-level survey microdata from the Ministry of
    Statistics and Programme Implementation ('MoSPI', Government of India)
    Microdata Portal <https://microdata.gov.in>. Provides functions to list
    datasets, list files within a dataset, and download individual files or
    entire datasets through the portal's 'NADA' API. 
